  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Decentralisation Liberia II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Decentralisation Liberia II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Liberia Decentralization Support Program II (LDSP II), implemented by UNDP as the
agreement partner for Sida, builds on previous support towards Liberia&apos;s decentralization
process (LDSP I, 2016-2020). LDSP II has been running since 2020 and Sweden will
enter as a donor during the period 2022-2024.  Overall,
the programme aims to reach the following outcomes:
Outcome 1: LGA reforms implemented through enhanced participation of
stakeholders (male, female, PWDs) in decision-making and service delivery,
Outcome 2: Local government institutions and services are fully devolved at the
assigned levels of government,
Outcome 3: County Service Centers empowered and capacitated for improved service delivery at the sub-national level.
Outcome 4: Legal and Regulatory Reforms developed and implemented to sustain
decentralization.
Outcome 5: Programme management support, coordination, and monitoring
strengthened.
Swedish support primarily focuses on fiscal decentralization.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Liberia Decentralization Support Programme II (LDSP II), som genomf&#xf6;rs av UNDP
som avtalspart f&#xf6;r Sida, bygger p&#xe5; ett tidigare st&#xf6;d till Liberias decentraliseringsprocess
(LDSP I, 2016-2020). LDSP II har p&#xe5;g&#xe5;tt sedan 2020 och Sverige kommer in som givare
under perioden 2022-2024. &#xd6;vergripande v&#xe4;ntas insatsen bidra till f&#xf6;ljande
resultat:
1. Reformer inom lagen f&#xf6;r lokalf&#xf6;rvaltning (Local Government Act) implementeras med
ett &#xf6;kat deltagande av r&#xe4;ttighetsb&#xe4;rare (kvinnor, m&#xe4;n och personer med
funktionsvariationer) i beslutsfattande och i tillhandah&#xe5;llandet av tj&#xe4;nster
2. Lokala, statliga institutioner och tj&#xe4;nster &#xe4;r fullt ut delegerade till tilldelade
myndighetsniv&#xe5;er
3. Lokala servicekontor (County Service Centers) st&#xe4;rks och ges &#xf6;kad kapacitet f&#xf6;r
f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad leverans av tj&#xe4;nster p&#xe5; lokal niv&#xe5;
4. R&#xe4;ttsliga och regulatoriska reformer utvecklas och implementeras f&#xf6;r att uppr&#xe4;tth&#xe5;lla
decentralisering
5. St&#xe4;rkt programledningsst&#xf6;d, samordning och uppf&#xf6;ljning. 
Sveriges st&#xf6;d till insatsen fokuserar fr&#xe4;mst p&#xe5; finansiell decentralisering.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome 1: LGA reforms implemented through enhanced participation of stakeholders (male, female, PWDs) in decision-making and service delivery 
Outcome 2: Local government institutions and services are fully devolved at the assigned levels of government 
Outcome 3: County Service Centers empowered and capacitated for improved service delivery at the sub-national level 
Outcome 4: Legal and Regulatory Reforms developed and implemented to sustain decentralization 
Outcome 5: Programme management support, coordination, and monitoring strengthened</narrative>
  </description>
